1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,380
Dear Obit Billionaires,

2
00:00:01,510 --> 00:00:03,350
join us in this bedtime prayer.

3
00:00:03,740 --> 00:00:04,880
Repeat after me.

4
00:00:07,679 --> 00:00:09,079
I welcome this quiet evening.

5
00:00:12,166 --> 00:00:12,886
My breathing grows

6
00:00:12,886 --> 00:00:14,014
slow and gentle.

7
00:00:16,760 --> 00:00:18,300
I release the hurry of today.

8
00:00:21,477 --> 00:00:22,227
I give thanks for

9
00:00:22,227 --> 00:00:23,223
what sustained me.

10
00:00:25,970 --> 00:00:27,090
I remember a kindness

11
00:00:27,090 --> 00:00:27,990
I received.

12
00:00:31,007 --> 00:00:32,422
I honour the effort I gave.

13
00:00:35,169 --> 00:00:36,019
Unfinished work

14
00:00:36,019 --> 00:00:37,199
can wait until tomorrow.

15
00:00:40,496 --> 00:00:42,046
I allow myself to rest tonight.

16
00:00:44,797 --> 00:00:45,727
I meet my worries

17
00:00:45,727 --> 00:00:46,677
with compassion.

18
00:00:50,134 --> 00:00:51,843
I need not solve everything now.

19
00:00:54,590 --> 00:00:56,100
May peace settle in my heart.

20
00:00:59,396 --> 00:01:00,346
May kindness fill

21
00:01:00,346 --> 00:01:01,266
the home around me.

22
00:01:04,015 --> 00:01:05,805
May those I love find comfort.

23
00:01:09,122 --> 00:01:09,872
May those without

24
00:01:09,872 --> 00:01:11,102
shelter find safety.

25
00:01:13,863 --> 00:01:15,503
I hold my family in gratitude.

26
00:01:18,690 --> 00:01:19,450
I wish peace to

27
00:01:19,450 --> 00:01:20,480
those working tonight.

28
00:01:23,232 --> 00:01:23,752
I remember the

29
00:01:23,752 --> 00:01:24,742
lonely and grieving.

30
00:01:27,929 --> 00:01:28,439
May they find

31
00:01:28,439 --> 00:01:29,369
care and company.

32
00:01:32,118 --> 00:01:33,668
I listen to my body's needs.

33
00:01:36,865 --> 00:01:37,725
I welcome care

34
00:01:37,725 --> 00:01:38,872
that supports my health.

35
00:01:41,619 --> 00:01:42,839
I seek help when I need it.

36
00:01:46,195 --> 00:01:47,055
I need not carry

37
00:01:47,055 --> 00:01:48,195
every burden alone.

38
00:01:50,943 --> 00:01:51,683
I make patient

39
00:01:51,683 --> 00:01:52,583
room for healing.

40
00:01:56,020 --> 00:01:57,300
I offer myself kindness

41
00:01:57,300 --> 00:01:58,330
without judgement.

42
00:02:01,091 --> 00:02:02,091
I release harsh words

43
00:02:02,091 --> 00:02:02,991
against myself.

44
00:02:06,268 --> 00:02:06,888
I can learn from

45
00:02:06,888 --> 00:02:07,948
today's mistakes.

46
00:02:10,696 --> 00:02:12,256
I keep one useful lesson.

47
00:02:15,323 --> 00:02:16,093
I let the remaining

48
00:02:16,093 --> 00:02:16,993
noise fade.

49
00:02:19,683 --> 00:02:20,563
May wisdom guide

50
00:02:20,563 --> 00:02:21,603
my next choices.

51
00:02:24,849 --> 00:02:25,909
May courage accompany

52
00:02:25,909 --> 00:02:27,019
uncertain days.

53
00:02:29,769 --> 00:02:30,899
May compassion shape

54
00:02:30,899 --> 00:02:32,189
my words and actions.

55
00:02:35,336 --> 00:02:36,236
May hope remain

56
00:02:36,236 --> 00:02:37,655
through difficult seasons.

57
00:02:40,402 --> 00:02:42,012
I am grateful for this pause.

58
00:02:45,028 --> 00:02:45,838
I give my mind

59
00:02:45,838 --> 00:02:46,927
permission to settle.

60
00:02:49,674 --> 00:02:51,544
I prepare for a peaceful rest.

61
00:02:54,830 --> 00:02:55,870
I welcome tomorrow

62
00:02:55,870 --> 00:02:57,020
as a fresh beginning.
